abstract: >-
  Analysis and visualization code accompanying the manuscript
  "Subordination experiences disrupt network adaptivity, biasing negative
  hippocampal recall". The repository contains figure-level MATLAB, R, and
  MRIcroGL scripts, shared analysis utilities, processed/derived inputs, and
  preprocessing code for methodological provenance.
